  "description": "Now barely twenty years old, Yun Hui-Su, who had been abandoned by his parents as a child and had lived on his own ever since, had always lived with a constant sense of loneliness. One day, while working as a delivery driver to make ends meet, a single mistake led to her being kidnapped and held captive by Sin Gyo-Yeon, a man who calls him “baby.” He had always believed that every misfortune had a cause and that everything that happened to him was his own fault, but right now, he is simply terrified of this man who can imprison him with a single word. Will he be able to console himself by believing that he, too, was to blame for this latest stroke of bad luck?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
